<script type="application/json" id="onlinebewertungen-embedded" data-origin-file="onlinebewertungen.json" data-origin-url="https://ctg-group.eu/onlinebewertungen.json">
{
	"text":"No public sales – no online business, no private customers - internal corporate distribution - corporate group. This company does not operate publicly and does not sell products or engage in online trade. We operate internally within a corporate group. There are no customers from online activities in any form. There are no private customers, no online shop, no public advertising and no sales area for consumers. We work exclusively within the corporate group with our business partners internally, which does not require a public presence. Our company operates a pure information website with company data: imprint, terms and conditions and privacy policy, as required by law, and for external contact, which represents the complete public relations work. For this reason, we do not appear online, which is customary in our industry and also does not generate any online reviews or rating profiles! As usual in our industry, new business relationships are only established internally through word-of-mouth and recommendations within the corporate group."
}
</script>

