			<tr><th>Primary Authorized Source</th><td>The primary database is maintained by the Department of Business Development (DBD):<br><a href="https://datawarehouse.dbd.go.th/company/profile/50525560001568" target="_blank">https://datawarehouse.dbd.go.th/company/profile/50525560001568</a></td></tr>
