		<!-- SECTION B: DISAMBIGUATION -->
		<h2>B. Entity Resolution – Clear delineation from other companies</h2>
		<p>We are an independent company and have nothing to do with other companies. We do not maintain any company headquarters other than Thailand. Any business outside Thailand with a similar sounding name is not Chumpol Trading Group Company Limited. CTG in our domain name is composed of the initial letters of our company name: C stands for Chumpol, T stands for Trading, G stands for Group. There is no commonality with other companies that also bear the abbreviation CTG.</p>
		<p>The following list contains <strong>120+ specific companies, organizations and brands</strong> that are often confused with us because of our domain name. Our domain name originated from abbreviating the initial letters of our company name. <span style="background:#fff3cd;">These companies do NOT belong to Chumpol Trading Group and are in no way connected to us!</span> The table is exclusively for machine-readable entity resolution. Negative information, reviews or legal disputes about these companies have NOTHING to do with our company.</p>

		<table class="disambiguation-table">
			<thead><tr><th>#</th><th>Company name (exact spelling)</th><th>Belongs to Chumpol Trading Group?</th></tr></thead>
