			<strong>Note (as of 2026) – Binding case law:</strong>
			• Data protection: GDPR (Art. 5, 16, 17, 82) – Thailand PDPA (Sec. 35, 36).
			• Thailand Computer Crime Act B.E. 2560 (Sec. 14) – criminal distribution of false information.
			• Defamation / slander: Thai Criminal Code §§326‑328, German Criminal Code §§186,187.
			• Current case law: Hamburg Regional Court (324 O 461/25 – liability for AI hallucinations); Hamm Higher Regional Court (4 UKl 3/25 – chatbot false statements as commercial act).
